From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anton Palgunov <toxblh@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 15:20:40 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 22/99] v8: e2k: wire up V8_TARGET_ARCH_E2K

Add the e2k target next to the existing e2k host support: target
detection and the host/target check in v8config.h, the gn source lists
and defines for v8_current_cpu == "e2k", and the architecture selection
in shared headers and sources. e2k follows the loong64 choices wherever
shared code distinguishes architectures. The target is native only,
there is no simulator.
---
